			<zone xml:id="p2z2-0" points="556,1864 606,1880 714,1850 878,1904 1012,1836 1132,1816 1146,1694 1070,1676 888,1736 720,1690 574,1694">572,1808 600,1813 629,1811 657,1808 686,1806 714,1804 743,1801 771,1798 800,1795 828,1793 857,1787 885,1783 914,1781 942,1778 971,1774 999,1770 1028,1766 1056,1763 1085,1763 1113,1762 1142,1760</zone>
